80","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":5,"pdf_page":174,"stem":"设AT = α1,α2,⋯,αn-1 矩阵, r AT\n是n × n-1 = n - 1,β1,β2 是与α1,α2, ⋯,αn-1 都正交的两\n个不同的n 维列向量, k 是任意常数, 则方程组Ax = 0 的通解为( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"k β1-β2","B":"k β1+β2","C":"kβ1","D":"kβ2"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-5.jpg","answer":"A","facets":["nullspace","vector_link"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-mcq-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":6,"pdf_page":174,"stem":"设n 维实列向量α 满足αTα = 2,A,B 均为n 阶矩阵, E 为n 阶单位矩阵, 且A E-2ααT = B,则( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.common"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"方程组BX = 0 与方程组E-2ααT X = 0 同解","B":"方程组BTX = 0 与方程组E-2ααT X = 0 同解","C":"方程组BX = 0 与方程组AX = 0 同解","D":"方程组BTX = 0 与方程组ATX = 0 同解"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-6.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["common_same","matrix_eq"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-mcq-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":7,"pdf_page":175,"stem":"设A 是n 阶实对称矩阵，B 是n 阶实矩阵, 若对任意n 维非零列向量α，都有αT AB+BTA α >\n0，则下列选项中正确的是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"方程组ABX = α 有无穷多解 B. 方程组ABX = α 无解","C":"方程组AX = α 有唯一解 D. 方程组AX = α 无解"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-7.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-mcq-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":8,"pdf_page":175,"stem":"设A,B 均为n 阶矩阵, α,β 均为n 维列向量.若α 可由A 的列向量线性表示, αT,βT 不能由\nAT,BT 的行向量线性表示，则下列结论中正确的是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"r B,β = r B B. r B,β = r B + 1","C":"r AT BT A= r AT,BT + 1 D. r A,α ,BT = r AT,BTαT βT B"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-8.jpg","answer":"C","facets":["solvability","vector_link"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-mcq-9","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":9,"pdf_page":175,"stem":"设f x 二阶可导, f x ≠0, a,f a , b,f b , c,f c 为曲线y = f x 上三个不同的点, Π1:x +\nay + f a z = f b ,Π2:x + by + f b z = f c ,Π3:x + cy + f c z = f a 为三个平面,则( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"三个平面交于一点 B. 三个平面交于一条直线","C":"三个平面相互平行 D. 三个平面两两相交,且交线互相平行"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-9.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-9.jpg","answer":"A","facets":["geometry","solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-mcq-10","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"mcq","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":10,"pdf_page":176,"stem":"设A 是m × n 矩阵, 则非齐次线性方程组AX = b 有解的充分必要条件是( ).","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability","la.eq.common"],"part":"hard","options":{"A":"r A = r AT = m B. r A = r AT = n= r AT AT","C":"r AT = m D. ATX = 0 与 X = 0 同解bT bT"},"img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-mcq-10.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-mcq-10.jpg","answer":"D","facets":["solvability","common_same"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-fill-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":1,"pdf_page":176,"stem":"设α1,α2,α3,β 均为三维列向量, A = β-α1-2α2-3α3,α1,α2,α3 , 则方程组Ax = β 的一个特解为_\n____.","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-fill-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-fill-1.jpg","facets":["structure","vector_link","matrix_eq"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-fill-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":2,"pdf_page":176,"stem":"设A = aij 3×3 为实矩阵，且Aij = aij i,j=1,2,3 ，其中Aij 为aij 的代数余子式，a33 = 1, A = 1,\nx1 0\n则方程组A x2 = 0 的解为_____.\nx3 1","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-fill-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-fill-2.jpg","facets":["rank_adjoint","matrix_eq"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-fill-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"fill","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":3,"pdf_page":177,"stem":"设A 是2 阶矩阵, 线性方程组AX = 3 2 T + 3,-4\n的通解为k -2,1 T.若β = 5,-10 T, 则βTAβ\n= _____.","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-fill-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-fill-3.jpg","facets":["structure","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-1","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":1,"pdf_page":177,"stem":"设A 是m × n 矩阵, r A = n - 2, 非齐次线性方程组Ax = b 的3 个解向量α1,α2,α3 满足α1 + α2 =\n1,2,3,4 T,α2 + 2α3 = -2,1,5,3 T,2α3 + 3α1 = 11,5,-6,7 T, 求方程组Ax = b 的通解.\nT + k(1, -2, 4,0)","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-1.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-1.jpg","facets":["structure","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":2,"pdf_page":178,"stem":"设A = α1,α2,α3,α4 是4 阶矩阵，非齐次线性方程组Ax = β 的通解为1,2,2,1\nT,k 为任意常数, 记B = α3,α2,α1,β-α4 .\n(I) 证明:r B = 2;\n(II) 求方程组Bx = α1 - α2 的通解.","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-2.jpg","facets":["structure","proof","matrix_eq","vector_link"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-3","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":3,"pdf_page":178,"stem":"设A 为3 × 4 矩阵, r A = 1, 若向量组α1 = 1,2,0,2 T,α2 = -1,-1,1,a T, α3 = 1,-1,a,5 T,α4 =\n2,a,-3,-5 T 与方程组Ax = 0 的基础解系等价, 求Ax = 0 的通解.","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure","la.eq.vector"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-3.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-3.jpg","facets":["nullspace","vector_link","compute_gauss"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-4","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":4,"pdf_page":179,"stem":"设A 是3 阶方阵，A = aij 3×3，且aij = Aij,i,j = 1,2,3，其中Aij 为aij 的代数余子式，a33 ≠0，\nb = a13,a23,a33 T, 求非齐次线性方程组Ax = b 的解.\na-3 -1 2","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-4.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-4.jpg","facets":["rank_adjoint","structure"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-5","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":5,"pdf_page":179,"stem":"设A = -1 a-3 2 , 且r E-A = 1.\n-1 -1 a\n(I) 求a 的值;\n(II) 若非零列向量α,β 满足A-E α = β, A2-E α = 2β, 求所有满足题意的α,β.\n-1 1","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-5.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-5.jpg","facets":["rank_adjoint","matrix_eq","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-6","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":6,"pdf_page":180,"stem":"设A = -1 0 1\n,B = -1 1 .\n-1 1 a\nb 2\n(I) 若方程组AX = 0 的解均是BTX = 0 的解, 但这两个方程组不同解, 求a,b 的值;\n(II) 若方程组AX = 0 与BTX = 0 有非零公共解, 求a,b 的值, 并求全部非零公共解.\n2 0 0 2 1 0 1 2 2 1","kp_ids":["la.eq.common","la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-6.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-6.jpg","facets":["common_same","nullspace","solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-7","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":7,"pdf_page":181,"stem":"设A = 1 1 0 3 ,B = 0 2 0 4 ,α = 2 ,β = 2 .\n0 1 3 5 0 -1 a-1 a-3 1 -1\n(I) 证明: 方程组AX = α 的解均是方程组BX = β 的解;\n(II) 若方程组AX = α 与方程组BX = β 不同解, 求a 的值.\na 1 1 b","kp_ids":["la.eq.common"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-7.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-7.jpg","facets":["common_same","proof","structure","solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-8","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":8,"pdf_page":182,"stem":"设矩阵A = 0 a-1 0 不可逆, β = 1 .已知方程组ATX = 0 的解均是βTX = 0 的解.\n1 1 a 1\n(I) 求a,b 的值;\n(II) 求可逆矩阵P，使得P-1AP = Λ.","kp_ids":["la.eq.common"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-8.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-8.jpg","facets":["common_same","solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-1-x2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":1,"pdf_page":183,"stem":"设A 是5 × 4 矩阵，r A = 2，已知α1,α2,α3 是非齐次线性方程组Ax = b 的三个解向量，且α1 +\nα2 = 4,6,-8,4 T,α3 = 1,2,-1,1 T, 又0,1,-3,0 T 是Ax = 0 的解, 求Ax = b 的通解.","kp_ids":["la.eq.structure"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-1-x2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-1-x2.jpg","facets":["structure","nullspace"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-2-x2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":2,"pdf_page":183,"stem":"设A 是m × n 矩阵，b 为m 维列向量，证明: 线性方程组ATAx = ATb 必有解.","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-2-x2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-2-x2.jpg","facets":["least_squares","proof","solvability"]},{"id":"ll-hard-13-big-3-x2","source":"lilin880","book":"linear","kind":"big","section":"13","section_name":"线性方程组","qno":3,"pdf_page":184,"stem":"(I) 设实矩阵Am×n 的秩为m，证明: 存在实矩阵Bn×m 且r B = m，使得AB = E，其中E 为m 阶\n单位矩阵.\n-1 0 1 -1\n(II) 若A = 1 -1 -1 -1 , 求满足AB = E 且r B = 3 的所有实矩阵B4×3.\n0 1 0 1","kp_ids":["la.eq.solvability"],"part":"hard","img":"/math/img/ll/ll-hard-13-big-3-x2.jpg","ans_img":"/math/img/ll-ans/ll-hard-13-big-3-x2.jpg","facets":["matrix_eq","proof","solvability","compute_gauss"]}]